<title>UK: Wet Brent trades at Feb Brent +10 cts, off 10 cts.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades at Feb Brent +10 cts, off 10 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A wet Brent cargo loading Jan 24-26 kept today by the equity holder was sold to a U.S. trader at February Brent +10 cents a barrel, traders said.</p>
<p>This compares with the sale of a Jan 22-24 loading cargo late on Wednesday at Feb Brent +20 cents.</p>
<p>--Colin Wooster, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
</text>
